---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Paw Rank"
  description="Learn how Paw Rank collects, uses, and protects your personal information when you visit pawrank.com or engage with our veterinary SEO services."
>
  <section class="policy-hero">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="policy-meta">Last Updated: March 2025 · Effective Immediately</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--white">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <article class="policy-content">
        <p>Welcome to <strong>Paw Rank</strong> ("we," "us," or "our"). We provide professional SEO services exclusively for veterinary clinics and veterinarians worldwide. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you visit <strong>pawrank.com</strong> or engage with our services.</p>
        <p>By using our website, you agree to the practices described in this policy. If you do not agree, please discontinue use of our website.</p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect information you voluntarily provide when you fill out our contact form, request a consultation, or communicate with us directly. The types of data we collect include:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Full name</li>
          <li>Email address</li>
          <li>Phone number</li>
          <li>Clinic or practice name</li>
          <li>Business location & website URL</li>
          <li>Service enquiry details</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We also automatically collect certain technical data when you visit our website, such as your IP address, browser type, device information, pages visited, and time spent on the site. This is collected through cookies and analytics tools described below.</p>

        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>To respond to enquiries</strong> — When you contact us via our form, we use your details to get back to you promptly.</li>
          <li><strong>To deliver our services</strong> — Your business information helps us tailor our SEO strategy specifically for your veterinary practice.</li>
          <li><strong>To improve our website</strong> — Analytics data helps us understand how visitors use Paw Rank and where we can improve.</li>
          <li><strong>To send relevant communications</strong> — With your consent, we may send you updates, tips, or offers related to veterinary SEO.</li>
          <li><strong>To comply with legal obligations</strong> — We may use or retain information as required by applicable law.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Cookies & Analytics Tools</h2>
        <p>We use the following third-party analytics tools to understand website traffic and user behaviour. These tools may place cookies on your device.</p>

        <h3>Google Analytics</h3>
        <p>Tracks page views, traffic sources, and overall site performance. Data is anonymised and aggregated.</p>
        <p><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Google's Privacy Policy →</a></p>

        <h3>Microsoft Clarity</h3>
        <p>Records session heatmaps and user interaction data to help us improve page usability and layout.</p>
        <p><a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/en-us/privacystatement" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Microsoft's Privacy Policy →</a></p>

        <p>You can control or opt out of cookies through your browser settings. Opting out of analytics cookies will not affect your ability to use our website. Note that Microsoft Clarity may record mouse movements, clicks, and scroll behaviour for analytical purposes — no personally identifiable information is captured through this tool.</p>

        <blockquote>By continuing to use pawrank.com, you consent to the use of cookies and analytics tracking described above.</blockquote>

        <h2>Third Party Services</h2>
        <p>We use trusted third-party platforms to operate efficiently and deliver a smooth client experience.</p>

        <h3>Calendly</h3>
        <p>Used for scheduling consultations and discovery calls. Collects your name, email, and availability.</p>
        <p><a href="https://calendly.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Calendly's Privacy Policy →</a></p>

        <h3>Mailchimp</h3>
        <p>Used to manage and send email communications to subscribers who have opted in to receive updates from us.</p>
        <p><a href="https://mailchimp.com/legal/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Mailchimp's Privacy Policy →</a></p>

        <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to any third parties for their own marketing purposes.</p>

        <h2>Marketing Communications</h2>
        <p>We plan to send occasional email communications to clients and subscribers, including SEO tips, industry updates, and service announcements relevant to veterinary practices.</p>
        <p>You will only receive marketing emails if you have explicitly opted in. Every marketing email we send will include a clear and easy <strong>unsubscribe option</strong>. You can opt out at any time with no questions asked.</p>

        <h2>Data Storage & Security</h2>
        <p>Paw Rank is based in Pakistan and serves clients globally. Your data may be stored and processed in jurisdictions outside your country of residence, including through our third-party tool providers whose servers may be located in the United States, European Union, or elsewhere.</p>
        <p>We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect your personal data against unauthorised access, loss, or misuse. However, no method of internet transmission is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
        <p>We retain your personal information only for as long as necessary to fulfil the purposes described in this policy, or as required by law. Contact form submissions are typically retained for up to 2 years.</p>

        <h2>Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Regardless of where you are located, you have the following rights over your personal data:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Right to Access</strong> — You can request a copy of the personal data we hold about you.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to Rectification</strong> — You can ask us to correct any inaccurate or incomplete information.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to Erasure</strong> — You can request that we delete your personal data, subject to legal obligations.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to Restriction</strong> — You can ask us to limit how we process your data in certain circumstances.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to Object</strong> — You can object to our processing of your data for marketing purposes at any time.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to Data Portability</strong> — You can request your data in a commonly used, machine-readable format.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise any of these rights, contact us at the address below. We will respond within 30 days.</p>

        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>Paw Rank's services are intended for business owners and professionals in the veterinary industry. Our website is not directed at children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from minors. If you believe a child has submitted information to us, please contact us immediately and we will delete it.</p>

        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices, tools, or legal requirements. When we do, we will update the "Last Updated" date at the top of this page. Continued use of our website after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.</p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or how we handle your data, please reach out to us:</p>
        <div class="contact-info">
          <p><strong>Paw Rank</strong> — SEO for Veterinary Practices</p>
          <p class="contact-row">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#325CE8" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
            <span>Email: <a href="mailto:pawrankofficial@gmail.com">pawrankofficial@gmail.com</a></span>
          </p>
          <p class="contact-row">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#325CE8" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
            <span>Website: <a href="https://pawrank.com">pawrank.com</a></span>
          </p>
          <p class="contact-row">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#325CE8" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
            <span>Based in Lahore, Pakistan · Operating Worldwide</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .policy-hero {
    background: var(--gradient-hero);
    padding: 150px 24px 64px;
    color: var(--pr-white);
  }

  .policy-hero h1 {
    color: var(--pr-white);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
  }

  .policy-meta {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .policy-content {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .policy-content h2 {
    font-size: 26px;
    margin-top: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--pr-border);
  }

  .policy-content h3 {
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-top: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .policy-content p {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .policy-content ul {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    padding-left: 24px;
  }

  .policy-content li {
    list-style: disc;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--pr-text);
  }

  .policy-content a {
    color: var(--pr-blue);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .policy-content blockquote {
    background: var(--pr-light-blue);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--pr-blue);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;
    padding: 16px 24px;
    margin: 24px 0;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .contact-info {
    background: var(--pr-chalk);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 24px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .contact-info p {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .contact-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .contact-row svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
</style>
